 {
  "id": "6a7264656e00000d",
  "type": "comment",
  "z": "6a7264656e000001",
  "x": 40,
  "y": 40,
  "name": "Setup: read me",
  "info": "1. Palette: install @flowfuse/node-red-dashboard (Dashboard 2.0).\n2. Edit the \"Mosquitto\" broker node (host/port/user) - default localhost:1883.\n3. On the garden board: MQTT panel -> server = this Mosquitto, topic prefix \"garden\".\n   If you change the prefix, change the 3 MQTT-in topics here too.\n4. Dashboard: http://<node-red>:1880/dashboard/garden\nMosquitto 2.x needs \"listener 1883\" + \"allow_anonymous true\" (or a password file) to accept the board."
 },
